Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: apps/ca.c
Line: 871
Function: ca_main
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: When EVP_PKEY_get_default_digest_name() returns 2 with "UNDEF" (e.g., for Ed25519/Ed448 keys), dgst is set to NULL (lines 846–848). Later, if req is set and -verbose is used, BIO_printf is called with "%s" and dgst (line 871), passing a NULL pointer to a %s formatter and causing a NULL dereference.

